# The Action layer's words for T45 (DEC-194; BOB's B140, the "Owed to UX" list of build/plan/current.md on tranche/T45).
# Each entry: (key, English, protected, note). Refusals are keyed refusal.<CODE>: the sentence says what happened, then what
# to do (DEC-83); BOB's drafts are kept where they already read so, and re-worded where they did not. Labels are keyed
# label.<set>.<value>. Run build_words.mjs after editing: it reads words-actions.json, which this file writes.
# Run: python3 docs/development/ux-substrate/screens/words-actions.src.py
import json, os
W = []
def w(key, en, prot=False, note=''):
    W.append(dict(key=key, en=en, protected=prot, note=note))
